Alembic migration scripts for the Inventory Backend.

Policy (see ../CLAUDE.md §10):
  - Every schema change ships with one Alembic revision in the SAME commit.
  - Never modify the database out of band.
  - Add new model modules to src/app/models/__init__.py so autogenerate
    actually sees them.

Common commands (run from Backend/):

  uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "add users table"
  uv run alembic upgrade head
  uv run alembic downgrade -1
  uv run alembic history
  uv run alembic current

The database URL is read from app settings (`Settings.database_url`)
inside env.py — alembic.ini's sqlalchemy.url is deliberately blank.
